    "detailed_description": "Experience the ultimate VR bow shooter, oVRshot! Immerse yourself in thrilling archery-based combat in multiple game modes. Choose from a variety of special abilities, adding depth and strategy to your gameplay. <br><br>Customize your character with a wide range of cosmetics, unlocking epic skins and visual upgrades. With a fully featured cosmetic system that everyone can enjoy, you'll be able to create your perfect avatar!<br><br>Engage in competitive multiplayer battles or vibe out in casual lobbies. oVRshot delivers an immersive and action-packed VR experience that will keep you hooked for hours. Get ready to wield your bow and become a legend in Stryker!<br><br>Join our discord community: <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790750/extras/68bba8ebff6095e8d0df95bda03dac5d.poster.avif?t=1715036407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790750/extras/68bba8ebff6095e8d0df95bda03dac5d.webm?t=1715036407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790750/extras/68bba8ebff6095e8d0df95bda03dac5d.mp4?t=1715036407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 vs 3 multiplayer action<br></li><li> Intensely fast-paced matches<br></li><li> Solo/coop vs AI<br></li><li> Awesome bow physics<br></li><li> Choice between 3 locomotion systems<br></li><li> Unique Abilities<br></li><li> Steam friends integration<br></li><li> Crossplay<br></li><li> In game voice chat<br></li><li> Upcoming Cosmetic System<br></li><li> Grapples, Double jumps, and Fast movement</li></ul>",
